CONTRACTS

        Six contracts are listed in the House of Commons Market:

                BQ  --  the Bloc Qubecois
                LIB  --  the Liberal Party
                NDP  --  the New Democratic Party
                PC  --  the Progressive Conservative Party
                REF  --  the Reform Party
                OT  --  Others

Contracts can be thought of as shares in political parties.  Each contract
