      P - Purchase at Current Ask$
            --  This option provides
            a somewhat quicker                  Figure 4 - Trading Menu
            facility for executing
            contract purchases than         P - Purchase at Current Ask$
            through submission of a         S - Sell at Current Bid$
            bid.  It will not,              B - Bid (Place an order to buy)
